00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:39.941
You know, look, this is
why I love social media.

00:01:39.941 --> 00:01:42.355
I believe that social
media is the plumbing

00:01:42.355 --> 00:01:43.840
to word of mouth in our society

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.577
and I think there's a lot of brands

00:01:45.577 --> 00:01:46.706
that don't spend marketing

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:49.942
